{"id":"n71274-1-8","stage":3,"title":"뻗다 · 伸展","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71274-1-8-1","ko":"가지를 왜 잘라 내니?","zh":"为什么把树枝剪掉？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가지를","meaning":"树枝，枝","explanation":"가지：树枝，枝；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"가지","audio":"/audio/b16bec1ce2b9561977e6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59919","senseId":"1","lemma":"가지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가지를","audio":"/audio/c76200853d2ffd110b67.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"잘라","meaning":"剪掉，切掉","explanation":"자르다：剪掉，切掉；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"자르다","audio":"/audio/1d818f15fdfd54e51260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17787","senseId":"4","lemma":"자르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘라","audio":"/audio/f215e75313727961651d.mp3"}},{"text":"내니?","meaning":"表示前句中的行动依靠自己的力量最终得以实现。","explanation":"내다：表示前句中的行动依靠自己的力量最终得以实现；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"내다","audio":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60625","senseId":"1","lemma":"내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내니","audio":"/audio/c02246698bad41b28472.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b16bec1ce2b95619","term":"가지","zh":"树枝，枝","audio":"/audio/b16bec1ce2b9561977e6.mp3","entryId":"59919","definition":"从树或草的主干分叉出去的小分支。","pronunciation":["가지"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"1d818f15fdfd54e5","term":"자르다","zh":"剪掉，切掉","audio":"/audio/1d818f15fdfd54e51260.mp3","entryId":"17787","definition":"从整体中将一部分拿掉。","pronunciation":["자르다"]},{"id":"3c